<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Cyanide</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">Huddy, Palaye Royale</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Cyanide</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">21UTBVeIK4swpoUkCya2TH</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1">7 Contributors</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Cyanide Lyrics</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Intro: Huddy]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Screamin' they hate me</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I love it, call me crazy</p><p ttm:agent="v1">'Cause in the end it's do or die</p><p ttm:agent="v1">So I'ma write my name in cyanide</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 1: Huddy]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You want a show? Love to see me hurting</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Since I was young, you placed a burden</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Sit down, you try to break me, well, I don't care</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I'll be your worst fucking nightmare</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Pre-Chorus: Huddy]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Kickin' through the door, who you lookin' for?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I'm a figure in the dark that you can't ignore</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And you know I stay on the move, different states on the news</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Out for blood, and I'm wantin' more</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus: Huddy]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">In my castle overseas, I've been working on my legacy</p><p ttm:agent="v1">All thesе secrets end with mе</p><p ttm:agent="v1">So watch me light 'em up with kerosene</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Screamin' they hate me, I love it, call me crazy</p><p ttm:agent="v1">'Cause in the end, it's do or die</p><p ttm:agent="v1">So I'ma write my name in cyanide[Verse 2: Remington Leith]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Third eye open, gonna rub it in</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Love the way it burns my skin</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Now I'm floating, but can't you fucking see</p><p ttm:agent="v1">That this is who I'm meant to be? Yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Pre-Chorus: Remington Leith]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Kickin' through the door, who you lookin' for?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I'm a figure in the dark that you can't ignore</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And you know I stay on the move, different states on the news</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Out for blood, and I'm wantin' more</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus: Huddy &amp; Remington Leith,</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Remington Leith</p><p ttm:agent="v1">]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">In my castle overseas, I've been working on my legacy</p><p ttm:agent="v1">All these secrets end with me</p><p ttm:agent="v1">So watch me light 'em up with kerosene</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Screamin' they hate me, I love it, call me crazy</p><p ttm:agent="v1">'Cause in the end, it's do or die</p><p ttm:agent="v1">So I'ma write my name in cyanide (</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Cyanide</p><p ttm:agent="v1">)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Bridge: Huddy &amp;</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Remington Leith</p><p ttm:agent="v1">]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Write my name</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You're begging me to go 'til you're begging me to stay</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Write my name</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Pistol to my heart, carve it in my grave</p><p ttm:agent="v1">So write my name</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You're begging me to go 'til you're begging me to stay</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Write my name</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Pistol to my heart, carve it in my grave[Chorus: Huddy &amp; Remington Leith]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">In my castle overseas, I've been working on my legacy</p><p ttm:agent="v1">All these secrets end with me</p><p ttm:agent="v1">So watch me light 'em up with kerosene</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Screamin' they hate me, I love it, call me crazy</p><p ttm:agent="v1">'Cause in the end, it's do or die</p><p ttm:agent="v1">So I'ma write my name in cyanide</p></div></body></tt>